# Ollama benchmark: qwen3.5:4b, CPU vs iGPU

> Note: GPU usage was observed during the iGPU test.

**Host:** local-ai · **Ollama:** 0.40.16 · **Model:** qwen3.5:4b · **Runs:** 5 each (cold start requested)

## Shared settings

| Setting      | Value |
|--------------|-------|
| think        | false |
| keep_alive   | 10m   |
| num_ctx      | 8192  |
| num_predict  | 400   |
| temperature  | 0     |
| seed         | 42    |
| num_thread   | 6     |
| num_gpu      | **0** (CPU) / **999** (iGPU) |

## Summary (median of 5 runs)

| Metric                | CPU        | iGPU       | Difference |
|-----------------------|------------|------------|------------|
| Generation speed      | 9.69 tok/s | 6.86 tok/s | iGPU ~29% slower |
| Total time            | 42.37 s    | 61.53 s    | +19.2 s |
| Load time             | 2.05 s     | 2.15 s     | about the same |
| Prompt processing     | 0.35 s     | 1.06 s     | iGPU ~3x slower |
| Output tokens         | 387        | 400        | — |
| Truncated runs        | 0 / 5      | 5 / 5      | iGPU hit the 400-token limit |

